Third-party components
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project ships no bundled runtime dependencies — it is a Salesforce DX
metadata project deployed into a Salesforce org, and all AI/search capabilities
are provided by the target org's Einstein and Data Cloud platform services.

The following development-only dependencies are used for linting, formatting,
and testing (see package.json for exact versions). They are not distributed as
part of the deployed application:

